Cell[TextData[{
 "The Arrays paclet is a domain-neutral abstraction over the array containers \
of the Wolfram Language: one dispatch layer for classifying, introspecting \
and operating on an array regardless of how it is stored. An expression is \
admitted as a container when its shape is introspectable without \
materializing its elements and a materialization path exists. Containers fall \
into three tiers. Explicit containers hold their elements in memory: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["SparseArray",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/SparseArray"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3c1262ec-aed2-4fd2-88cc-9008807921c7"],
 ", packed and plain ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["List",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/List"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ae0f441a-b573-4653-b70e-af5ead8135f7"],
 " arrays, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["NumericArray",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/NumericArray"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b9f2c334-c666-4715-97a5-f39f63297dc6"],
 ", structured arrays such as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["SymmetrizedArray",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/SymmetrizedArray"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"3b67ad21-c6ef-4de3-88ab-bb4c24ed61df"],
 ", and the shape-introspectable wrappers ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["QuantityArray",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/QuantityArray"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "f2d022d2-4b24-4de5-89b4-6676b7bbd40c"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TabularColumn",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/TabularColumn"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "0588adfd-5827-485b-bcfd-f2a58e1f2abc"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Tabular",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Tabular"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "92baf3ef-b8c2-43cd-8ee1-3ca2e9d0f32e"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Dataset",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Dataset"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "e058480c-cb0e-401a-b90e-a21b7c9d3e6a"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["ByteArray",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/ByteArray"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "16101a27-bd7e-42a1-812b-14e12203a0d4"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["EventSeries",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/EventSeries"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "08cc98a7-e550-4b15-bfed-67dc6ee271ff"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DataStructure",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/DataStructure"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3a935a3e-61af-479d-8500-98eee58256bf"],
 " array stores. Lazy parametric containers are array-valued inert \
applications awaiting their parameters, admitted through a registry of heads: \
an array-valued ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["InterpolatingFunction",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/InterpolatingFunction"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"c3454782-0212-4234-ba96-26832c5678f6"],
 ", a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["ParametricFunction",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/ParametricFunction"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"e7c11b6c-44a9-438b-b860-1fac9d9a5fe5"],
 ", an unapplied ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Function",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Function"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2df7b531-228f-4f7f-8376-4db35421e576"],
 ", an array-valued ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Piecewise",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Piecewise"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "0ce8fbdc-79f1-4d27-95ae-fb8b56645a25"],
 ". Symbolic containers have no elements at all: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["VectorSymbol",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/VectorSymbol"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a1b5ff8b-da07-4a48-a0c4-f461743b0d63"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["MatrixSymbol",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/MatrixSymbol"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8727a464-fb06-43da-b578-900e10725853"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["ArraySymbol",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/ArraySymbol"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "71e0156f-0ec0-4091-bd82-6b8d1e99fc01"],
 ", symbols registered in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["$Assumptions",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/$Assumptions"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4298a129-05c6-4b8d-a7a8-0fbe82a5b837"],
 ", and inactive tensor trees over them. Whether a container also computes in \
place, without materializing, is a per-head capability rather than a \
requirement for admission."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e75220ec-c19d-4c80-9b79-caf614d1bae6"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 "Details",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneSelectorBox[{True->
   TemplateBox[{"Details", 
     Cell[
      BoxData[
       FrameBox[
        Cell[
        "Details may include a long description of the resource's contents, \
